{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything did not go according to the plan. Sooner or later, being in control of the refinery could slip away from your hands. And well\u2026 It did. The deadly Sawblade attack took everything from you. Your friend, Victor, is gone. Fuel gone. Equipment gone. Crew members gone. Time to assemble the first vehicle from scrap, gather a new crew and get back on track. There is no time to waste, because The Great Storm is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you embark on desert expeditions, combat will be inevitable. Take command of your crew and make the most of a wide array of weapons to survive and win your battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/344a15017710b243f5ec30b489e934b5.poster.avif?t=1753095269\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/344a15017710b243f5ec30b489e934b5.webm?t=1753095269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/344a15017710b243f5ec30b489e934b5.mp4?t=1753095269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dust Raiders features a dynamic economy system with demand and supply, and random events that can affect the market. You'll need to make strategic decisions about what goods to buy and sell to maximize your profits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/1160a0968ee07d198a685a43599058dd.poster.avif?t=1753095269\" width=600 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/1160a0968ee07d198a685a43599058dd.webm?t=1753095269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ride customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping struggling enclaves, finishing quests and gathering crew members will unlock new customization options for your vehicles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast hostile areas to explore </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to complete main story and side missions you will need to explore four huge hostile areas ranging from borders of Eternal Desert, through contaminated marshes and abandoned Polis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/8433eaf93d8561d8fdd58c3de36cebae.poster.avif?t=1753095269\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/8433eaf93d8561d8fdd58c3de36cebae.webm?t=1753095269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/8433eaf93d8561d8fdd58c3de36cebae.mp4?t=1753095269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Revenge?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/e576e2b52ca65ea81d473216c0f0b28eef7050ec.jpg"},{"name":"Final Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/5dc5e81616501fec66d246c242859bb5ca4bcac8.jpg"},{"name":"A Lucky Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/879387fc55244d6407714345b4b1f64f9d7b055e.jpg"},{"name":"Money Talks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/12b7a5ab5b9033a79c916379fdc3c1a61daa908b.jpg"},{"name":"Born To Roam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/70f0379cb89e6e3cae3bb2b46d64bf710102f084.jpg"},{"name":"Wanderlust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/f2865fb809cf5139e84ec3ca00a9b60404df8cef.jpg"},{"name":"What's Left Behind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/8acb6afa04bc27a58d2c3412d0169d29f96ab5b9.jpg"},{"name":"Mass Production","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/ff58d739db0fe496d4990cf3cb4e3305fcb31864.jpg"},{"name":"Multi-Tasking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/ed41cc6bebfeb0c195bbb00699195111b5901aab.jpg"},{"name":"Burden Of Care","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2397450/abfb1c761375eb3f118eba0b8663d0f66802112f.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2397450?t=1753095269","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2397450?t=1753095269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753095269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753095269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Most mature contect would come from car fights, where you and your enemies try to shoot down each other cars using weapons. Other than that the story itself will mention about violence and criminal acts happening in the wasteland. You will also deal with outlaws and criminals."},"demos":[{"appid":3509010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything did not go according to the plan. Sooner or later, being in control of the refinery could slip away from your hands. And well\u2026 It did. The deadly Sawblade attack took everything from you. Your friend, Victor, is gone. Fuel gone. Equipment gone. Crew members gone. Time to assemble the first vehicle from scrap, gather a new crew and get back on track. There is no time to waste, because The Great Storm is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you embark on desert expeditions, combat will be inevitable. Take command of your crew and make the most of a wide array of weapons to survive and win your battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/344a15017710b243f5ec30b489e934b5.poster.avif?t=1753095269\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/344a15017710b243f5ec30b489e934b5.webm?t=1753095269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/344a15017710b243f5ec30b489e934b5.mp4?t=1753095269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dust Raiders features a dynamic economy system with demand and supply, and random events that can affect the market. You'll need to make strategic decisions about what goods to buy and sell to maximize your profits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/1160a0968ee07d198a685a43599058dd.poster.avif?t=1753095269\" width=600 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/1160a0968ee07d198a685a43599058dd.webm?t=1753095269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ride customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping struggling enclaves, finishing quests and gathering crew members will unlock new customization options for your vehicles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast hostile areas to explore </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to complete main story and side missions you will need to explore four huge hostile areas ranging from borders of Eternal Desert, through contaminated marshes and abandoned Polis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397450/extras/8433eaf93d8561d8fdd58c3de36cebae.poster.avif?t=1753095269\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap